y the kuey-jin. Ravnos wasn't <i>killed</i> by the nukes, but we don't know if he wasn't <i>affected </i>by them. That they had a more pronounced effect on the bodhisattvas it's undeniable, but if Ravnos was or wasn't bothered by the nukes depends on how much of that damage was caused by the kuey-which it's unknown.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}